## Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| **Frontend** | React + Vite + TypeScript | Developer velocity, strong typing, modern UI |
| **Backend** | FastAPI (Python) | Async LLM calls, API routing, middleware for policy checks |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL + Prisma | Typed ORM, complex relational data, audit logs, migration management |
| **Tool Execution** | Docker containers | Isolation, ephemeral environments, scalable to ECS/EKS |
| **Storage** | Object Storage (S3 or equivalent) | Evidence artifacts with SHA-256 integrity hashes |
| **Design** | Black/white/grey palette, minimal SVG components | Professional, lightweight |

