## Iteration Model

The modular architecture makes extending trivial:

| Change | What to Touch | What's Untouched |
|---|---|---|
| **Add a new tool** | JSON schema + Docker container + Tool Manager registration | AI, Database, Policy Engine |
| **Upgrade the AI** | LLM service layer (swap API calls) | Database, Tools, Policy |
| **Update rules** | Prisma schema + migration | AI, Tools, Frontend |

