## Reporting Pipeline

```
PostgreSQL + Object Storage
        ↓
  Report Generator
   ├── Aggregate Metadata (scope, duration, timeline)
   ├── Map Findings → Risk Matrix (CVSS / severity)
   ├── Attach Verified Evidence Hashes & Screenshots
   └── Generate Decision & Governance Audit Appendix
        ↓
  ┌──────────────┐     ┌──────────────────────┐
  │  Executive   │     │  Technical & Audit    │
  │  Summary     │     │  Appendix             │
  │  (PDF/Web)   │     │  (Markdown/JSON)      │
  └──────────────┘     └──────────────────────┘
```

### Report Sections
- **Scope & Governance Summary:** Authorization docs, target CIDRs, time windows
- **Executive Finding Matrix:** Prioritized by severity, business impact, remediation complexity
- **Detailed Findings & Cryptographic Evidence:** Technical descriptions + immutable content hashes
- **Complete Activity Log:** Append-only timeline of every observation, hypothesis, policy check, and action
